<h2>{% trans %}What this module does{% endtrans %}</h2>
<p>{% trans %}Blue Marloc Config Sync lets you inspect and export configuration entities, making it easier to align environments and resolve UUID mismatches.{% endtrans %}</p>

<h2>{% trans %}Access the tools{% endtrans %}</h2>
<ol>
  <li>{% trans %}Go to <strong>Configuration → Development → Config Sync</strong>.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Use the tabs to choose between batch exports, entity relationship diagrams, or UUID comparisons.{% endtrans %}</li>
</ol>

<h2>{% trans %}Tips for success{% endtrans %}</h2>
<ul>
  <li>{% trans %}Ensure the configuration sync directory defined in <code>settings.php</code> is writable before running exports.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Run exports in a staging environment first when you plan to promote changes to production.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Use the ERD tab to understand how fields and references connect before changing content models.{% endtrans %}</li>
</ul>
